.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, UHF/aug-cc-pVTZ, energy. This calculation shows the orbital energies of the sodium atom in Hartree-Fock theory, where minus the energy of the highest occupied orbital approximates the ionisation energy (Koopmans' theorem).
